    "In-target ID sets were stable where they were non-empty: SE 13 of 14 union IDs appeared in every repeat (mean Jaccard 0.9643); NW and NE returned identical in-target sets in all 4 repeats (Jaccard 1.0). Rank order was not stable: core IDs shifted on average 6.7 (SE), 12.5 (NW), and 10.4 (NE) rank positions between repeats.",
